          "status": "running",
          "note": "Maximize light exposure while working, do deep focus work in this phase."
        },
        {
          "text": "Phase 2 (8-16 hours after waking)",
          "status": "running",
          "note": "Do easier tasks during this phase of the day if possible. Begin dimming lights as the day goes on."
        },
        {
          "text": "Phase 3 (16-24 hours after waking)",
          "status": "running",
          "note": "Ideally, sleep during this phase, however if you choose to do work, work in an environment that is as dimly lit as possible whilst still being able to do work."
        }
